# Response headers for the static side of the site.
#
# The page loads nothing but its own two files plus images from Steam's CDNs,
# so the policy can be an allowlist rather than a set of exceptions: anything
# injected into this page has nowhere to send what it finds.
#
# Steam serves achievement art from several hostnames depending on the game's
# age, so all four are listed: shared.cloudflare, shared.akamai and cdn.* under
# steamstatic.com, plus the older steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net.
#
# The one script host that is not us is Cloudflare's analytics beacon, which
# the edge injects into this page. It was being refused, which cost the
# statistics it exists for and wrote an error in every visitor's console.

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'none'; object-src 'none'; script-src 'self' https://static.cloudflareinsights.com; style-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data: https://*.steamstatic.com https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net https://media.steampowered.com; connect-src 'self'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'
  # Two years, subdomains included, and preload-eligible. The site is HTTPS
  # only; without this a browser's first visit still tries plain HTTP, which
  # is the one request an attacker on the same network can rewrite.
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), camera=(), microphone=(), interest-cohort=()
